   "priceMinor": 38500,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "The Monoc Nib is an integrated titanium nib unit designed and manufactured in house by Schon DSGN. It is machined from solid titanium bar stock and utilizes a feed machined from amber Ultem, which darkens and takes on the color of the ink when in use. Its novel design and construction leads to a unique writing experience; the Monoc has a feel all its own and offers a dynamic array of line characteristics with multiple tip shapes to choose from Purchase Options The Monoc Nib is offered as a stand alone nib unit without a pen. To combine it with any fountain pen in our store in the place of a standard Jowo nib, add both the pen and Monoc of your choice to your cart. Be sure to select \"I'm Adding a Monoc\" as your choice of nib when adding your pen to your cart. Use the code “Monoc Combo” and receive a $50 discount off your nib purchase! Nib Sizing We currently have four tip shapes available for the Monoc nib: Fine, Medium, Cursive and Architect . The Fine tip has a fine line that gets finer with higher angle writing, and a large reverse with an expressive architect-like characteristic. The Medium has a wider line weight with a finer line on the reverse. The Cursive has a finer horizontal stroke, wider vertical stroke, and a very large and wet reverse. The Architect has a finer vertical stroke and a wider horizontal stroke, and a finer reverse. click here to see a writing sample of all our Monoc nib sizes. Made To Order Monoc nibs are individually finished, hand ground and tested to order. Please allow 5-10 working days for your nib to ship. Cleaning The Monoc Nib comes with a custom syringe cleaning tool designed to help you keep your Monoc in good shape for many years to come! Click here to read our full instruction set on using and caring for your Monoc nib. Returns/Restocking Please review our FAQ for our most recent returns policy and restocking fees on returned Monoc nibs.",
